@startuml
title D2 — SPG / Surefyre — Product Architecture

left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam wrapWidth 220
skinparam maxMessageSize 120
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 85
skinparam padding 18
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 12
  BorderThickness 1.4
}
skinparam package {
  RoundCorner 14
  BorderThickness 1.6
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8D6
  BorderColor #C8A84E
}

actor "Retail Agent /\nAgency User" as Agent
actor "Underwriter /\nOperations User" as Underwriter

package "SUREFYRE PLATFORM" as Surefyre #EAF4EA {
  rectangle "Agent Portal\n\nExternal entry point for:\n• new submissions\n• documents\n• status and messages" as Portal #EAF2FF

  rectangle "Rules and Workflow\n\n• field validation\n• completeness checks\n• routing and referrals\n• task creation" as Rules #F3F8E8

  rectangle "Underwriting Workbench\n\nInternal workspace for:\n• review\n• requests for information\n• rating and quoting\n• decisions and referrals" as Workbench #EAF2FF

  Portal -right-> Rules : Submit and validate
  Rules -right-> Workbench : Route work
}

rectangle "AIM\n\nCore insurance\noperations and\ntransaction data" as AIM #FFF1DF

rectangle "ImageRight\n\nDocuments,\ncorrespondence and\nworkflow references" as ImageRight #FFF1DF

rectangle "Carrier, Rating and\nThird-Party Services\n\nExternal decisions,\nrates and enrichment" as External #FFF1DF

Agent -right-> Portal : Application data,\ndocuments and messages
Workbench -right-> Underwriter : Assigned work,\nstatus and decisions

Workbench -down-> AIM : Transaction and\npolicy-related data
Workbench -down-> ImageRight : Documents and\nmetadata
Workbench -down-> External : Rating, data or\ncarrier request

AIM -up-> Workbench : Transaction result\nor status
ImageRight -up-> Workbench : Document ID or\nworkflow status
External -up-> Workbench : Rate, response or\nenrichment data

Workbench ..left..> Portal : Status, requests,\nquote and documents
Portal ..left..> Agent : User-facing response

legend bottom
|= Component |= Primary purpose |
| Agent Portal | External submission and communication |
| Rules and Workflow | Validation, routing, referrals and tasks |
| Underwriting Workbench | Internal review, rating, quoting and decisions |
| AIM | Core insurance operations and transaction processing |
| ImageRight | Insurance document and workflow management |
| External Services | Carrier, rating and third-party integrations |
endlegend

note bottom of Surefyre
Simplified interview model.
Exact system-of-record ownership and integration direction
should be confirmed with SPG during implementation discovery.
end note

@enduml
